+//     MutationObserver, checked in its own microtask, so no later task (a timer, a
+//     script reading the dock's rect) sees the new layout under the old plate. The
+//     check observes the cells that joined;
+//   - a box changed size for any other reason: the one ResizeObserver (root, regions,
